  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "At a market after leaving poison grassland, Fang Yuan buys one eagle wings Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          441
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "purchase-and-later-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "It lets the user twist and turn easily in the sky, which he judges more efficient for him than rank four flying cloud Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          441
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "purchase-and-later-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "On his back it appears as a tattoo of a pair of eagle wings.",
        "chapters": [
          459
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "purchase-and-later-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "As a rank four Gu Master holding this rank three Gu, he treats flight as an easy escape if a fight turns against him.",
        "chapters": [
          456
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "purchase-and-later-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_master"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He barely uses it while posing as Wolf King Chang Shan Yin, then takes Gu from Ge tribe’s warehouse and, after failing twice, refines the rank three eagle wings into rank four eagle rise Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          496
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "purchase-and-later-use",
